            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Recall is now Mix Audit. Existing sessions and workspaces can still be opened.
- Redesigned Record, Playback, Settings, and Playback Review with the new app icon and menu bar controls.
- Test playback supports 15-second skip buttons and 5-second arrow-key skips.
- Initial playback and seeks skip mixer values that already match and restore changed controls in bounded batches.
]]></description>
